                    <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">—</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">When this Character, or a Character in base contact with this Character, is targeted by an ATTACK, it may reduce the attacker’s dice pool by 1 (to a minimum of 1 die). If the attacker is a COG, it instead suffers −1 ATTACK for that attack. A Character can benefit from one Shield against an attack.</characteristic>
