                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Massive Swing: If this weapon inflicts a Strike against an Enemy Character, the attack also acts as a SHOVE ACTION. If that SHOVE is stopped by terrain or causes a fall, the target suffers an additional [STUN] [STUN] [STUN]. Resolve this damage as part of the same attack, applying RESILIENCE only once.</characteristic>
