        <constraint id="bf31-3ebc-8916-bf8f" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="a939-7709-7ca2-b9c3" name="Heart Shaped Phylactery" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="68" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Vampire only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per game, when this Character would be killed, you may destroy this item instead. If you do, the Character survives with 1 VITALITY.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="1791-b04d-fba8-0556" name="Golden Scepter" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="68" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="25" />
      </costs>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="8b6f-9956-1352-31ca" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="89ea-a370-e05c-129c" name="Golden Scepter" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="68" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Vampire only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per turn, when activating a Blood Boon, this Character may activate one additional purchased rank without counting it towards its Power limit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="c811-afd3-9745-b9ce" name="The Master’s Call" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="71" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="20" />
      </costs>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="2ba1-f8f1-6f3f-9b67" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="83d4-bec6-7844-7c3b" name="The Master’s Call" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="71" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Vampire only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per activation, choose a friendly MORTAL within 12" of this character. That MORTAL may immediately perform a free SPRINT ACTION towards this Character. This SPRINT cannot generate Charge Attacks, and Disengage tests are required as normal.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="3546-ad47-8f89-4b36" name="Blood King’s Mandate" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="71" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="40" />
      </costs>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="39e8-7e27-5835-df83" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="89e2-41bc-46a9-5972" name="Blood King’s Mandate" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="71" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Royal only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">When this ROYAL would kill an enemy MORTAL with a MELEE ATTACK, it may make an opposed POWER TEST against that Character before removing that enemy from play. On a failure, resolve the casualty normally. On a success, the enemy MORTAL is defeated and counts as a casualty for its original crew, including that crew's normal Activation Token removal, but is immediately placed under your control in the same position with half VITALITY (rounding up). It retains any equipped weapons and assets, including their abilities, even if your crew could not normally purchase them.
The converted Character does not add an Activation Token to your Chaos Bag. When a converted Character is killed, do not remove another Activation Token from your Chaos Bag. If it has an assigned friendly Activation Token, set that token aside until the next Reset Phase, then return it to the Chaos Bag.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
  </sharedSelectionEntries>
</catalogue>